{"arguments": null, "input": "const p = await tools.update_plan({explanation:\"Implementation, constructor translation, concrete execution, symbolic abstraction, and all proof claims are in place. Running the final clean audit now.\",plan:[\n  {step:\"Inspect prompt, translator subset, and reference K semantics\",status:\"completed\"},\n  {step:\"Implement solution.py and generate solution.mpy\",status:\"completed\"},\n  {step:\"Write verification.k, spec.k, and prove.sh\",status:\"completed\"},\n  {step:\"Compile, exercise with krun, and close all kprove claims\",status:\"completed\"},\n  {step:\"Audit deliverables and report exact result\",status:\"in_progress\"}\n]});\nconst r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"./prove.sh > prove.log 2>&1\\nstatus=$?\\nprintf 'prove.sh exit: %s\\\\n' \\\"$status\\\"\\nrg -n '^#Top$|<k>|<exc>|<exit-code>' prove.log\\npython3 - <<'PY'\\nimport math\\nfrom solution import greatest_common_divisor\\nfor a in range(-100, 101):\\n    for b in range(-100, 101):\\n        assert greatest_common_divisor(a, b) == math.gcd(a, b), (a, b)\\nprint(\\\"CPython exhaustive check: 40401 pairs passed\\\")\\nPY\\nfor f in solution.py solution.mpy verification.k spec.k prove.sh; do test -s \\\"$f\\\" && printf '%s: present\\\\n' \\\"$f\\\"; done\\nls -l solution.py solution.mpy verification.k spec.k prove.sh\",workdir:\"/work\",yield_time_ms:1000,max_output_tokens:12000});\ntext(p);\ntext(JSON.stringify(r));", "line": 465, "message": null, "name": "exec", "phase": null, "type": "custom_tool_call"}
